    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents have pleasure in offering 3 Beechlawn Avenue to the market. This deceptively spacious 3 bedroomed semi-detached property has a garage to side which is suitable for conversion should extra accommodation be required subject to planning permission. This property is meticulously maintained by its current owner & benefits from a downstairs shower room and a kitchen extension to rear. Situated in this enviable residential location, just off Oscar Traynor Road the property is well served by established amenities in the vicinity. The property is further complimented by a large rear garden which enjoys a westerly orientation and a cobblelock driveway to front providing off-street parking. Viewing strongly recommended.\n\nSituated in this mature residential location, there are established amenities within the vicinity, a choice of shopping centres Northside/Artane and Lidl/Aldi supermarkets. There are schools, child care facilities, as well as a number of sports clubs. Beaumont hospital, DCU and Dublin International Airport are easily accessible and easy access to M1/M50 motorways. There are a choice of bus routes on the Oscar Traynor Road."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance - 1.93m (6'4\") x 1.72m (5'8\")\nPVC front door. Tield floor. Recessed lighting.\n\nReception Hall\n\nLounge - 4.13m (13'7\") x 2.36m (7'9\")\n\nDining Room - 4.14m (13'7\") x 3.34m (10'11\")\nMarble fireplace. Laminate flooring. PVC french doors to rear.\n\nBreakfast Room - 3.33m (10'11\") x 2.96m (9'9\")\nPVC doors to rear.\n\nKitchen - 3.69m (12'1\") x 2.87m (9'5\")\nRange of shaker fitted press unites. Tiled behind. Laminate flooring. PVC door to rear.\n\nLobby - 1.63m (5'4\") x 1.04m (3'5\")\nTiled floor.\n\nDownstairs Shower Room\nElectric shower, screen, whb and wc. Recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.22m (13'10\") x 3.16m (10'4\")\nSliderobes. Recessed lighting. Laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.59m (11'9\") x 2.81m (9'3\")\nBuilt in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.86m (9'5\") x 2.75m (9'0\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\n\nShower Room\nShower, screen, whb and wc. Recessed lighting. Fully tiled floor & walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PVC double glazed windows </li><li> Gas central heating </li><li> Garage c. 11sq.m plumbed for washing machine </li><li> Cobblelock driveway providing off street parking </li><li> Westerly rear orientation </li><li> On onward chain </li><li> Sought after address</li></ul>"
      },
